    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Mullery O’Gara are pleased to present to the market 23A Fairbrook Lawn. A deceptively spacious modern semi detached residence, one of a pair built in c. 1998 and situated in a quiet cul de sac overlooking communal green to the front. \r\n\r\nExcellently maintained throughout and tastefully presented with a spacious secluded aspect and side entrance. The accommodation briefly comprises of entrance porch, hall, lounge, livingroom, kitchen/dining, utility and guest w.c. Upstairs are 3 bedrooms (one ensuite), all bedrooms have fitted wardrobes. The main bathroom completes the internal accommodation. \r\n\r\nOutside is off street parking to the front and secluded southerly gardens to the rear which are not overlooked with side garden and side entrance. \r\n\r\nThe property is wonderfully positioned within walking distance of Rathfarnham Village and Shopping Centre. Beside a number of transport links into the city centre and close to the M50 connecting further afield. The property is convenient to St. Enda’s park and Marlay Park with its 50 acres of paths, sporting facilities and weekend market is within 5 mins. This location is extremely well serviced with public transport links which offer quick and easy access to the city centre and further afield."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Porch \r\n\r\nLounge \r\nCeiling Coving, centre rose and dado rail \r\n\r\nInner Hall \r\nW.c, whb with tiled floor. \r\n\r\nUtility \r\nSink unit, freezer, plumbed for washing machine, CH boiler, part tiled and tiled floor. \r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining \r\nRange of overhead and undercounter fitted units, plumbed for washing machine and dishwasher. \r\nSink unit, and extractor fan. Pannelled ceilings, recessed lights and opening to  \r\n\r\nLiving Room\r\nVelux window, recessed lights. Sliding patio door to rear garden. \r\n\r\nUpstairs\r\nBedroom 1 (Front) Ensuite  \r\nFitted wardrobes\r\nEnsuite \r\nTriton shower, w.c and whb. \r\n\r\nBedroom 2 (Rear) \r\nFitted wardrobes\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 (Rear) \r\nFitted wardrobes\r\n\r\nBathroom\r\nBath with shower attachment, w.c, whb. Part tiled. \r\n\r\nOutside \r\nOff street parking ot the front with paving and hedging. \r\nSecluded south facing gardens to rear which are not overlooked. Cobblelocked patio area with side garden and side passage. Walled with a variety of shrubs."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "100 SqM / 1,076Sq Ft\r\nGFCH\r\nDouble glazed windows\r\nSpacious accommodation \r\nOff street parking\r\nSecluded southerly gardens\r\nSide access\r\nWalking distance to a host of schools\r\nBeside numerous recreational and shopping facilities\r\nConvenient location to fantastic transport links"
      },
